+/**
+ * Credits are CodeBuddy's billing unit rather than USD. There is no published
+ * USD price per credit, so we surface the multiplier through the model *name*
+ * suffix (e.g. "DeepSeek V4 (x0.51 cr)") and leave the numeric cost fields at
+ * zero — that keeps `/model` and the footer from claiming "free" while never
+ * inventing a dollar figure we cannot compute.
+ */
